                                                "sense_id": "1f54de68-5e52-327d-8c98-c9379c8772e4",
                                                "text": "My friend […] discovered in his early teen years a passion for both men and opera. He frequented the Met to satisfy his ear but had little knowledge or experience of where to find partners and satisfy his groin."
